ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6d/md6jwdsspcg0xj9daextz2ml9ot8uql.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%8D%E5%B1%88%E6%8A%B5%E6%8A%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6d/md6jwdsspcg0xj9daextz2ml9ot8uql.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />不屈抵抗\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）战斗开始时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">不屈抵抗</span>]，效果：<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]触发的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无限不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无限不屈</font></span></span>]在持续时间结束时，若自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血脉沸腾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血脉沸腾</font></span></span>]不少于<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层，则消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层并使持续时间延长<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />✦战斗回合数为<font color=\"#ed7950\">7</font>的倍数时，行动开始时获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血脉沸腾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血脉沸腾</font></span></span>]，并回复[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]中触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无限不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无限不屈</font></span></span>]的次数。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E5%88%97%E5%85%8B%E8%B0%A2%E2%80%A2%E9%A3%8E%E9%9B%AA%E5%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿列克谢•风雪孤行\"><img alt=\"头像 阿列克谢•风雪孤行.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e7/p3uev98o9wqyvt0sj9v59pw1twf9swg.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">阿列克谢•风雪孤行</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022064556\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.416 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.547 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9836/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 159886/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11768/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  527.457      1 模板:简